-- FORK: סעיף 346(ג1) | before both conditions hold no step is due, and the DEONTIC ends FULFILLED, which means only that the Act lays down no step for these facts | the entry as a standing duty of the Registrar from the application
-- TIMELINE: unit=none stated; day 0=the day both conditions are met; counting="silent"
